'''Vilaxoyosa''' ({{Literal translation|house of the Xoyosa}}) is a [[Planned communities in Balisca|planned community]] in the [[Llaragón]] region of the [[Bayara|Bayaran community]]. Originally built between 1957 and 1960 to provide accommodation for workers at the the site of the [[Aipi|Aipi reservoir]], it has since grew into an industrial center and rail hub in southern Bayara.

